    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners Darragh Ó Sé are thrilled to bring to the market a superb c. 1.438 acre site located in Booleenshere in the highly sought-after coastal village of Ballyheigue. Ideally positioned on Church Road with stunning sea and mountain views, this attractive parcel of land offers an excellent setting for a private residence subject to the necessary planning permissions. Current Owner has Planning Permission.\r\nLocated just moments from Ballyheigue’s renowned Blue Flag beach, the site enjoys the perfect balance of coastal tranquillity and village convenience. The area is celebrated for its scenic beauty, vibrant community atmosphere, and easy access to local amenities including shops, cafés, schools, sporting facilities, and the world-famous Ballyheigue Castle Golf Club.This well-situated site benefits from easy road access, access to public Water Mains and Sewage system and enjoys a peaceful yet central location, making it ideal for those seeking to build a family home, holiday retreat, or investment property along the Wild Atlantic Way. Viewing is highly recommended"
      },
      {
